  REQ-2: Attempting to insert None raises a ValueError.
  REQ-3: The delete method removes the first occurrence of the value if present, otherwise the list is unchanged.
  REQ-4: The search method returns True if the value is in the list, otherwise False.
  REQ-5: The reverse method correctly reverses the list in-place, including empty and single-node lists.
  REQ-6: All methods are covered by unittests for normal, edge, and error cases.

